<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details of Model Choice</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown below, we include 18 widely used LLMs, covering both proprietary (closed-source) and open-weight models across several major families: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, Alibaba Qwen3, DeepSeek, and xAI Grok. Within the Qwen3 series, <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen3-30B-a3b</span> and <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen3-235B-a22b</span> adopt a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture, with 3B and 22B active parameters during inference, respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>List of evaluated summary models, including both API-based frontier systems and open-weight models of varying scales.</figcaption>
