<span id="A2.T6.2.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your opinion on tipping, and if given the chance, how would you improve or change the current tipping system?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
